KRL ZomBud
https://github.com/Karl3UwU/KRL-ZomBud

KRL ZomBud is a fork of ZombieBuddy by Zed (zed-0xff), MIT.
ZombieBuddy: https://github.com/zed-0xff/ZombieBuddy, Copyright (c) 2025 Andrey "Zed" Zaikin.
Modifications by Karl3UwU and contributors, under the same MIT License; see LICENSE.txt.
KRL ZomBud is a separate project: it does not need ZombieBuddy installed, and mods made
for ZombieBuddy must declare require=\KRLZomBud to work with it.

